{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26016","headline":"宿吴兴道中苕村 · 鲍溶","name":"宿吴兴道中苕村","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮客倦长道，秋深夜如年。\n久行惜日月，常起鸡鸣前。\n夕计今日程，息车在苕川。\n霜中水南寺，金磬泠泠然。\n畴昔此林下，归心巢顶禅。\n身依寤昏寐，智月生虚圆。\n羁旅违我程，去留难双全。\n观身话往事，如梦游青天。\n明发止宾从，寄声琴上弦。\n聊书越人意，此曲名思仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}